{"name": "Dice Have No Eyes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're smart. You roll few dice, get few points. It's enough. Time to bank... but wait-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're smarter. One more roll. Perfect, double your points. Just one more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a genius. You keep winning. You're the chosen one. The dice love you. One more roll and you take it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're stupid. You lose it all. You swear they're judging you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/deb0d34e5ead6a68cd14b3f94833c09f.poster.avif?t=1783918330\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/deb0d34e5ead6a68cd14b3f94833c09f.webm?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/deb0d34e5ead6a68cd14b3f94833c09f.mp4?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dice Have No Eyes\u00a0is a dice-rolling Balatro-like fever dream\u00a0about greed management.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Every roll carries a chance for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But every roll carries a risk of bust. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Improve and swap your dice with each cleared level.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect trinkets and discover broken synergies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/c891b7dbf0898b8357ead030c5fd58a4.poster.avif?t=1783918330\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/c891b7dbf0898b8357ead030c5fd58a4.webm?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/c891b7dbf0898b8357ead030c5fd58a4.mp4?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S THERE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ trinkets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ spells and snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RNG powered by God n' Fate engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic dice effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 companions with unique powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pretty decent art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dice with no eyes whatsoever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced tickle mechanic technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night mode for your poor tired eyes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S TO COME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More trinkets, spells, snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New dreamy worlds to play in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More playable characters and silly shopkeepers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge runs and run modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An entity claiming to be God</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strait of Hormuz resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dares and quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music sourced straight from starving indie musicians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite Mode? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/78c5015af0afa061e6fcdbb0716adf6a.poster.avif?t=1783918330\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/78c5015af0afa061e6fcdbb0716adf6a.webm?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/extras/78c5015af0afa061e6fcdbb0716adf6a.mp4?t=1783918330\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> <br/>Made by two guys </p> </div>", "short_desc": "\u2605 Surreal dice-rolling roguelike about luck and greed \u2605 Feed your dice dumplings, collect game bending trinkets, roll too much and lose it all. Or get lucky, unlock King Fetus, meet God and you might just wake up.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535880/d62115f0814d2b12ab6460ceda67de951a32b4fe/header.jpg?t=1783918330", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Roguelike", "Surreal", "Gambling", "Pixel Graphics", "Atmospheric"], "developers": "Franek, Max Cahill", "publishers": "Franek, Max Cahill", "release_date": "May 19, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "4535880", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/RJDfd_I6y5I", "first_seen": 1779235200.0, "review_rank"